{"id": "unknown-2026-10-02-006", "date": "2026-10-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 40, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Researchers develop a novel non-destructive way to calculate the lifetime of blue phosphorescent OLEDs", "content": "<p>Researchers from KAIST with colleagues from Hanbat National University, Kyung Hee University, and the Applied Surface Technology Ascend (ASTA) institute have developed a novel non-destructive methods to find the lifetime of blue phosphorescent OLED devices. This could lead to faster and cheaper way to design new PHOLED emitters, as there's no need for long age tests.</p><div class=\"align-center\">\n  \n  <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/2026-10/Electroluminescent-characteri", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/researcher-develop-novel-non-destructive-way-calculate-lifetime-blue", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "boe-2026-10-02-007", "date": "2026-10-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 40, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": ["boe"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Huawei launches the Mate 90 smartphone family, sporting the world's brightest display at 12,000 nits", "content": "<p>Huawei announced its new flagship <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/huawei-mate-90-mate-90-pro-mate-90-max\">Mate 90 smartphone family</a>. All three phone models sport high-end LTPO AMOLED displays, produced by BOE. The two higher-end modules utilize BOE's latest tandem-stack OLEDs, achieving a peak brightness of 12,000 nits - to claim the world's brightest smartphone display ever.</p><img src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/inline-images/huawei-mate-90.jpg\" data-entity-uuid=\"", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/huawei-launches-mate-90-smartphone-family-sporting-worlds-brightest-display", "type": "rss"}]}
